  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"今天就在 ServerAtelier 獲取您的預算遊戲伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Rails/main/gallery/rays_3d_rails_title_wide.png\" alt=\"rays 3d rails 寬版標題圖\"></p>\n<p>此資源包會更改 Minecraft 中鐵軌的方塊與物品紋理。<br>\n自 3.0 版本起支援着色器。</p>\n<p>它本身不會新增任何物品或方塊，而是覆蓋下方列出的模組及原版已有的鐵軌模型。  </p>\n<h2>支援的模組：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania (Fabric/Quilt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns & Chasms</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopperrails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Rails</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/little-logistics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Logistics</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernminecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Minecarts</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Minecarts and Rails</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rail-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Rail Variants (MStV+)</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oxidized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oxidized</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spelunkery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spelunkery</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-locomotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Locomotion</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-railroads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Useful Railroads</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fRail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版</a> <code>// 4 種樣式 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xannoszs-better-minecarts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xannosz's Better Minecarts</a> <code>// 1 種樣式</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您希望支援其他模組，請告訴我。</p>\n<h2>連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source_code-lightgray?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label= &labelColor=555555\" alt=\"原始碼徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WXdSYn4yHB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 社群徽章\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frays-3d-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/jKa9Ievs?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=1BD964\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/861245?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=FF8041\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數徽章\"></a></p>",
